	(footprint "rev6:MiniDIN6_PS2_Socket_CUI_MD-60S"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "cb7cf821-4175-4e2c-8705-39e94b097ad9")
		(at 84 0)
		(descr "Mini-DIN 6-pin (PS/2) female PCB socket, right-angle THT, Same Sky / CUI Devices MD-60S; hole grid also matches Kycon KMDGX-6S. Amiga A4000 keyboard connector, which uses the PS/2 pin positions exactly: 1=KDAT 3=GND 4=+5V 5=KCLK, 2 and 6 NC. Dimensions from the Same Sky MD-S series datasheet dated 09/12/2024, page 3, MD-60S Recommended PCB Layout / Top View / Date Codes after 03/03/2022, https://www.sameskydevices.com/product/resource/md-s.pdf : 6 x 0.9 +0.1/-0 mm dia holes, row 3/1/2/4 at 8.50 mm and row 5/6 at 11.00 mm from the mating face (X MIRRORED from the datasheet drawing: the Same Sky layout is drawn with the mating face at the BOTTOM of the page, i.e. rotated 180 deg from this footprint's face-at-y=0 orientation, which also reverses left/right. Sanity rule for this footprint (mating face at y=0, body at +y): an observer facing the socket sees left-to-right = DECREASING x, so the front view reads 6(+3.4) 5(-3.4) upper, 4(+3.4) 3(-3.4) middle, 2(+1.3) 1(-1.3) lower - the standard PS/2 female socket front view, which is the mirror of the plug), outer columns 6.80 mm apart and the inner pair 2.60 mm apart, earth-terminal slot 2.2 x 0.7 mm on the centreline 4.70 mm from the face, body 14.0 x 12.4 x 12.8 mm. Cross-checked against Kycon KMDGX-xS-N rev B5 (03/28/18) 6-position Recommended PCB Layout (Bottom View), https://www.kycon.com/Pub_Eng_Draw/KMDGX-xS-N.pdf , which gives the same grid with 1.10 mm dia holes and a 2.30 mm dia locating boss in place of the earth tab (Kycon grid numbers map to standard pins as 1=1 2=2 3=3 5=4 6=5 8=6). Holes are drilled 1.10 mm and the centre feature is one plated 2.40 mm hole (pad SH) that clears both the CUI earth tab and the Kycon boss. Anchor (0,0) = centre of the mating face plane - place it on the board edge line. VERIFY AGAINST A PHYSICAL SAMPLE BEFORE FAB.")
		(tags "connector mini-din minidin md-60s kmdgx ps2 ps/2 6-pin socket receptacle right-angle tht amiga keyboard a4000 amigahid rev6")
